<title>PHILIPPINES: Republic Cement sets cap hike, stock div.</title>
<headline>Republic Cement sets cap hike, stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Cement Corp said on Friday its board had approved an increase in authorised capital to three billion pesos from the present 1.5 billion.</p>
<p>The board also approved a resolution declaring a 50 percent stock dividend, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Its A and B shares would also be declassified into a single class, it added.</p>
<p>Republic is an affiliate of Aboitiz Equity Ventures Inc.</p>
<p>- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
